+{% if services.bmp is defined and bgp.as is defined %}
+{#
+  BMP MONITORING STATION, PASSIVE. The device listens on services.bmp.port and the
+  station dials in; `connection address` names the station and is written VERBATIM
+  (a DNS name stays a name -- whether this EOS release accepts a hostname there is
+  proven on a device, not assumed). resolve_bmp() has already dropped the block from
